  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Find the unit setting",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Inbox</strong>, then <strong>Set your unit to watch its area ›</strong> at the end. It lists your admins' ORBAT, or a built-in rifle company until they publish one.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/22f7e2f67d350b55.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Go into your platoon",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>›</strong> at the right of your platoon's row to go into it. Tapping the row itself picks that unit.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/92fb8bc2e9bdb982.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Tap your squad or platoon",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap your squad, or the platoon's card at the top if you lead the platoon, here <strong>1J</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c42037f6c5798c38.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See what your unit reports",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The Inbox now watches 1J's area and, as you lead 1J, counts its squads' reports under <strong>Reported by your unit</strong>. Tap <strong>Done</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/48c9c077081bd061.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See your unit in Markers",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Markers</strong> and pick <strong>Friendly</strong>. The <strong>Unit</strong> cell above <strong>Cancel</strong> now reads your unit, here <strong>1J</strong>, so friendly marks you place belong to it unless you pick another.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a77ee5a536da31e2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Change it later",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>≡</strong>, scroll the tools to <strong>OpenDefence Main</strong> and tap your unit under <strong>My unit</strong>, here <strong>1J</strong>. <strong>No unit</strong>, the last row of the list that opens, clears it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/79ec74a1cf62834d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
